{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415809","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415809","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1041580901:0":{"text":"Hmph...","source_cn":"哼……<key:dialog18>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x650EA8D21D4E9D56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580902:0":{"text":"Your Majesty, what troubles you? Allow me to share the burden.","source_cn":"陛下，是什么事惹您烦扰？属下愿意替您分忧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02C3E14ACC3480A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580903:0":{"text":"I'm afraid even you can't help with this.","source_cn":"只怕你帮不上忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x259FB6FF0D8D26BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580904:1":{"text":"Then I have failed you.","source_cn":"是属下无能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56D3BDD1842FDFB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580905:0":{"text":"It's not a matter of ability. The affairs of state cannot be entrusted to another.","source_cn":"不是你无能，而是治理国家之事，无法假手他人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1973C70F12F167C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580906:0":{"text":"Not even to you, my most loyal guard.","source_cn":"即便那个人是你，我最忠诚的禁卫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB78B371CB99A1BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580907:0":{"text":"No one shall ever dare betray you again, Your Majesty. Should any fool grow so bold, I shall deal with him myself.","source_cn":"绝对不会再有人敢背叛您，陛下。即便真有胆大妄为的家伙，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47E70849644AC849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580908:0":{"text":"I've never doubted your loyalty, Grezhul.","source_cn":"我从不怀疑你的忠心，格瑞泽尔勒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFA561BCC7D35757","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580909:0":{"text":"But trust is a luxury. Even now, when I stand among the dead, I cannot afford to take that risk.","source_cn":"但信任是一件奢侈的东西。即使如今我面对的是亡灵，也一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD90DB83B7B4ECD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580910:0":{"text":"Living or dead, all souls are easily corrupted by power and ambition. There is no need to risk the realm again.","source_cn":"活人和死人都会被权利和欲望侵染，没必要再冒这个险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF89595D7ACCFED20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580911:0":{"text":"I will remember your words, Your Majesty.","source_cn":"属下会牢记您的教诲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x354104D9856EE6E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041580912:0":{"text":"And I will always treasure the trust you have placed in me. I will never betray it.","source_cn":"陛下对我的信任，属下也一直铭记于心，永远都不会辜负。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE803F17F567BE8D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041580913:0":{"text":"For you, and for Bantus, I will gather more loyal souls and raise an army of Graveborn who answer to you and you alone.","source_cn":"为了陛下，为了班题斯，属下必定竭尽全力为您搜罗更多忠诚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x198DD65D1E377A04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041580914:0":{"text":"One day, all of Esperia shall bow before you!","source_cn":"伊索米亚，终有一日会成为您的囊中之物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C11352A3EAF8036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041580915:0":{"text":"See that you keep your vow.","source_cn":"记住你的许诺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71E709825580A355","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:托安":{"text":"Thoran","source":"托安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格瑞泽尔勒":{"text":"Grezhul","source":"格瑞泽尔勒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":2}}